        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9955/32, 1-1/4 Inch Clear Glass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1-1/4\" classic clear glass cabinet knob goes great with any door knobs in the <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\">Omnia Prodigy Collection</a> and is a match for the <a href=\"/products/classic-beauty-clear-glass-knobset-omnia-955td\">Omnia 955 Door Knob</a>. It's classic traditional style is accented with 7 beautiful finish choices. It is great for use all over the house--not just on kitchen cabinets. Update your tired furniture by switching out old cabinet hardware for this new, traditional style. It can also be used on the bathroom cabinets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 9955/32 Classic Clear Glass Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Glass Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/omnia-finish-colors\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE3_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Prodigy Finishes Diagram\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
